<report>
<title>Diversity</title>
<block name="var">
<line></line>
<subtitle>Analysis for <in>ti</in>:</subtitle>
<line></line>
<line>Total number of counts = <in>n</in>  <warn><in>msg</in></warn></line>
<line>Number of classes observed (richness) = <in>s</in></line>
<line></line>
<line><b>Estimated total number of classes = <in>stotal</in></b></line>
<line>Standard error (large sample) = <inu>se-largeSample</inu></line>
<line><ci>Normal (large sample) <in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from-largeSample</in> to <in>to-largeSample</in></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line><b>Simpson D<sub>s</sub> (Hurlburt PIE) = <inu>simpson</inu>  </b>(dominance <i>l</i> = <inu>dom</inu>, <i>d<sub>s</sub></i> = <in>ds</in>)</line>
<line>Standard error (large sample) = <inu>se-simpson-largeSample</inu></line>
<line>Standard error (small sample) = <inu>ses-simpson</inu></line>
<line><ci>Normal (large sample) <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-simpson-largeSample</inu> to <inu>to-simpson-largeSample</inu></ci></line>
<line>Re-samples = <in>boots</in>, bias = <inu>bias-simpson</inu>, standard error (bootstrap) = <inu>se-simpson-bootstrap</inu></line>
<line><ci>Normal (bootstrap) <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-simpson-bootstrap</inu> to <inu>to-simpson-bootstrap</inu></ci></line>
<line><ci>Centred bootstrap-t <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-simpson-bootstrap-t</inu> to <inu>to-simpson-bootstrap-t</inu></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line><b>Shannon H' (base e) = <inu>shannon</inu></b></line>
<line>Standard error (large sample) = <inu>se-shannon-largeSample</inu></line>
<line>Standard error (small sample) = <inu>ses-shannon</inu></line>
<line><ci>Normal (large sample) <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-shannon-largeSample</inu> to <inu>to-shannon-largeSample</inu></ci></line>
<line>Re-samples = <in>boots</in>, bias = <inu>bias-shannon</inu>, standard error (bootstrap) = <inu>se-shannon-bootstrap</inu></line>
<line><ci>Normal (bootstrap) <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-shannon-bootstrap</inu> to <inu>to-shannon-bootstrap</inu></ci></line>
<line><ci>Centred bootstrap-t <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-shannon-bootstrap-t</inu> to <inu>to-shannon-bootstrap-t</inu></ci></line>
</block>
</report>
